 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/07/20 20:00| 02 | 039| 020| 0506| 0228| 0164| 0652|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/07/20 19:36| 01 | 314| 026| 0272| 0048| 0190| 0365|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/07/20 12:48| 05 | 263| 092| 0359| 0103| 0191| 0651|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/07/20 12:12| 02 | 064| 026| 0269| 0132| 0134| 0529|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/07/20 09:48| 03 | 284| 062| 0340| 0156| 0119| 0671|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/07/20 02:00| 02 | 227| 076| 032"
